sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Agent
    participant Guardrails
    participant ModelClient
    participant Result

    User->>Agent: RunContext
    Agent->>Guardrails: validate input and config
    alt blocked
        Guardrails-->>Agent: violation
        Agent->>Result: blocked AgentResult
    else valid
        Agent->>Agent: build messages
        Agent->>ModelClient: ModelRequest
        ModelClient-->>Agent: ModelResponse
        Agent->>Result: completed AgentResult
    end
